{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664880/extras/10172d7e7ad4974da039adcae61920b0.avif?t=1770678867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664880/extras_big/10172d7e7ad4974da039adcae61920b0.avif?t=1770678867 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT??? WHAT AM I LOOKING AT???</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>( THAT is what you are thinking, I just KNOW it. )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snail Tail is a game where you play as a snail guy (\u00a0THEY HAVE A TAIL, STOP ASKING. )\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a silly RPG where you go through many humorous escapades in order to play a game you've been hyping for a long time. Yup, that's your entire motive<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664880/extras/b18dbb0457af49bee0322e2e0b1c4287.avif?t=1770678867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664880/extras_big/b18dbb0457af49bee0322e2e0b1c4287.avif?t=1770678867 width=800 height=516 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Snail Magnitude</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn Based 2D battle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROLL\u00a0 \u00a0 IN YOUR SHELL.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional Story I Think</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool FRIENDS !!!\u00a0 you can MAKE !!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUT STICKERS ON YOUR SHELL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FISH.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggleable profanity switch</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664880?t=1770678867","background_raw":"https://shared.akam